        },
        {
          "text": "’Dini adripi mani, mani lele, emi ma avani ma vale tu ovupi ayiko mani pi diza mani be ’diyi, emi ma so pa okporu Opi ma alia, ’ba mani lele ’diyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHP.4.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHP.4.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHP 4:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ma azi Ewodia tia, ma azi vini Sunituke tia, yi ma ovu egata alu be Opi ma alia. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHP.4.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHP.4.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
