        },
        {
          "text": "Te emi ofe afa dria ma dri ’bo, afa mani aga ra; afa ga ma dri tre, mani afa engapi emi vu Epafroditoni ejile ’diyi a’ile ’borisi, eri afa aji be arikariru, afa fele edetaru ovupi a’izaru, ayiko fepi Mungu driri’i. ",
          "type": "text",
